OVERVIEW: Calculate study statistics and metrics

USAGE: dicom-study stats <path> [--detailed] [--format <format>]

ARGUMENTS:
  <path>                  Study directory

OPTIONS:
  --detailed              Show detailed statistics
  -f, --format <format>   Output format: 'text' or 'json' (default: text). JSON
                          adds PS3.6 keyword keys (StudyInstanceUID,
                          NumberOfStudyRelatedSeries,
                          NumberOfStudyRelatedInstances); the former keys are
                          deprecated (default: text)
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

